  "title": "Pumpkin Dessert",
  "description": "Pumpkin desserts come in a variety of forms but this one takes the cake! Cake mix stands in for pastry crust in this delicious alternative to pumpkin pie.",
  "authors": [
    "Bea Gassman"
  ],
